### 2. Replace the body of the one listed definition

Overwrite `tests/calc/steps/concept13b4354efb42d97fb2de7c428a7011995700d0f26a06ebb3f9c6eb1c150d5f87.go`
with exactly this content. The package clause, the `//truebdd:concept when "halving"`
